<title>JAPAN: Yamazaki to buy back its shares.</title>
<headline>Yamazaki to buy back its shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yamazaki Co Ltd said on Wednesday it plans to buy back up to 400,000 of its shares, or up to 400 million yen worth, in order to introduce a stock option scheme.</p>
<p>Yamazaki makes machinery parts and machine tools.</p>
</text>
